{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.170000076293945,"text":"A massive rock rising up, with a small monastery at its foot, and people, smaller still, on the paths. It is a landscape which was unusual for its time. Painting then mostly wanted faces and stories. The young Theotokopoulos made it in Crete, or shortly after leaving, while he was still working in a technique close to Byzantine icons, with gold and fine lines.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"massive","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"rock","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"rising","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"up","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":2.140000104904175},{"word":"with","start":2.4800000190734863,"end":2.5399999618530273},{"word":"a","start":2.5399999618530273,"end":2.7799999713897705},{"word":"small","start":2.7799999713897705,"end":3.119999885559082},{"word":"monastery","start":3.119999885559082,"end":3.5},{"word":"at","start":3.5,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"its","start":3.859999895095825,"end":4.079999923706055},{"word":"foot","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"and","start":4.760000228881836,"end":4.940000057220459},{"word":"people","start":4.940000057220459,"end":5.300000190734863},{"word":"smaller","start":5.760000228881836,"end":5.840000152587891},{"word":"still","start":5.840000152587891,"end":6.28000020980835},{"word":"on","start":6.460000038146973,"end":6.599999904632568},{"word":"the","start":6.599999904632568,"end":6.78000020980835},{"word":"paths","start":6.78000020980835,"end":7.119999885559082},{"word":"It","start":7.840000152587891,"end":7.980000019073486},{"word":"is","start":7.980000019073486,"end":8.140000343322754},{"word":"a","start":8.140000343322754,"end":8.520000457763672},{"word":"landscape","start":8.520000457763672,"end":8.640000343322754},{"word":"which","start":8.640000343322754,"end":9},{"word":"wa